- [ ] Linter: No errors  
- [ ] Build: Successful
- [ ] No console errors in dev mode

### Functional Testing
For each modified file:
- [ ] Feature 1: [Name]
  - [ ] Happy path tested
  - [ ] Edge cases tested
  - [ ] Error cases tested
